\u03bb.description:
An arbitrary parameter used to trace out the path (worldline) of a particle through spacetime. For massive particles, this is often proper time (

$τ$
). For massless particles, a different parameterization is needed as proper time is undefined. The units are dimensionless as it is purely a parameter for progression along a curve.

